behavior, use appropriate commands, inspect the result, recognize common failure conditions, and apply suitable controls in a CI/CD and production environment.\n\n## Section Reference\n\nNavigation: Production Hands-on Lab\nSection: Production Hands-on Lab — Container Lifecycle and Networking\nSection ID: stage-8-topic-16-section-7"
